        <p>'up prta,guz Tut pannb asstis vicompui %iota nof num mai n '824011 0.412 Zoz apun.Pl time. I have a new one every month. They ait all ungrateful." "All? " said Ruby, "how very sad." • _ _</p>
        <p>"Of course it ifi sad, but ;ve must expect it. Human nature is very bad." "I don't know much about human nature," said Ruby. "Then I'll teach you. I think we shall get on for a month at all events."</p>
