        <p>NOTICE TO CORREPONDENT.S.</p>
        <p>Authors of letters intended for publicatitn muat in at cases send their names and addresses to the Editor. Matters intended for publication must bo wiitten one side only of the paper. Correspondents are strongly advisrd to write briefly. A shirt letter has much greater chance of insertion than a long one.</p>
